{\b Ecomsp Survey Studio - pre-release software}\par\par
This is a pre-release version of Survey Studio, provided for evaluation and pilot use.\par\par
{\b What it does to your data.} Survey Studio copies footage from camera cards to this computer and never changes the cards or the original files. Survey locations entered for sunset and sunrise times are not saved in any file. It works offline and opens no network connections to other computers, unless your organisation connects it to a team hub.\par\par
{\b No warranty.} The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Results must be checked by a qualified ecologist before they are used in a report or submission. The publisher is not liable for any loss arising from its use.\par\par
{\b Third-party software.} Survey Studio uses ffmpeg (installed separately), exiftool (optional) and open-source Python components listed in the software bill of materials published with each release.\par\par
Use beyond evaluation needs a written agreement with the publisher.\par
